Thought: I need to find the MRS/Optica Congressional Science and Engineering Fellow for 2024-2025 and determine which committee in MRS is responsible for contributing to governmental science and technology policy. The first step is to visit the "Committees" page to explore relevant information.

Action: visit_page
Action Input: {"button": "Committees"}

Memory:
-The MRS/Optica Congressional Science and Engineering Fellow for 2024-2025 is part of the MRS/Optica Congressional Fellows Group, which is a subcommittee of the Government Affairs Committee. The Government Affairs Committee is responsible for contributing to governmental science and technology policy in materials-related areas.
"}
